  "system": {
    "identifier": "binding-shot",
    "description": "<p>You launch a set of thrown weapons wrapped in Battle Wire at an enemy, intended to use them as a much more lethal bola. Target an enemy within range, make a ranged taijutsu attack. On a hit the target takes [Weapons damage] + 2d10. The target then must make a Dexterity saving thrown, being Restrained on a failure and no effects on a successful save. A creature who begins its turn Restrained by this jutsu gains 2 ranks of Bleeding. A creature can remake the save at the end of their turns.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: You can choose to instead; select a point you can see in range. All creatures within 5 feet of the chosen point becomes targets for this Jutsu’s attack. Compare the result vs the AC of each creature in range dealing damage and applying the affects as normal.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
